## 2. Scope 1: Direct Emissions

Scope 1 emissions are minimal, primarily stemming from the use of refrigerants in HVAC systems across our four global offices and a small fleet of company-owned vehicles used for local administrative tasks.

| Source | Location | FY 2024 Emissions (tCO₂e) | Notes |
|:---|:---|:---:|:---|
| Refrigerants (HFCs) | All Offices | 12 | Based on estimated leakage rates |
| Company Vehicles (Fuel) | Boston HQ & London | 3 | Small administrative fleet |
| **Total Scope 1** | | **15** | |

