## 5. Carbon Intensity Metrics

To benchmark our performance, we calculate key carbon intensity metrics for FY 2024.

| Metric | Calculation | FY 2024 Result |
|:---|:---|:---:|
| **Carbon per Employee** | Total Emissions / Total Employees | 2,850 tCO₂e / 1,200 = **2.375 tCO₂e/employee** |
| **Carbon per Revenue** | Total Emissions / Total Revenue (AED) | 2,850 tCO₂e / 485,100,000 AED = **0.00587 kg CO₂e/AED** |
| **Carbon per Square Foot** | Scope 2 Emissions / Total Office Area | 835 tCO₂e / 140,000 sq ft = **0.00596 tCO₂e/sq ft** |

