## 6. Next Steps and Reduction Targets

The primary focus for emissions reduction will be on Scope 3 (Cloud Computing) and Scope 2 (Office Energy).

| Target Area | Action Plan | Cross-Reference | Target Reduction (FY 2025) |
|:---|:---|:---|:---:|
| **Cloud Optimization** | Migrate non-critical workloads to AWS regions with lower carbon intensity grids (e.g., US West). Implement serverless architecture for 20% of the Engineering team's services. | **OPS-003: IT Infrastructure** | 15% reduction in Cloud Emissions |
| **Renewable Energy** | Execute PPAs for Boston and London offices. | **STRAT-005: Global Real Estate Strategy** | 50% reduction in Scope 2 Emissions |
| **Commuting** | Promote and incentivize public transport and remote work options. | **HR-001: Employee Handbook** | 10% reduction in Commuting Emissions |

